---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Home — Editorial
theme: editorial
permalink: /explore/editorial/
description: Recruiting and staffing for students starting out and professionals moving on — plus the employers who hire both.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

{# ---------- 1. Hero: magazine opener — type, then a wide photo with a mono caption ---------- #}
<section class="section-container pt-12 pb-14 sm:pt-20">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-10">
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 lg:pt-4">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/45">Est. 2013 — Chicago, IL</p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[24ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
        A recruiting practice for people at the start of a career and people in the middle of one.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center -space-x-2.5">
        {% for face in ["priya", "sofia", "james", "aisha", "daniel"] %}
        <img src="{{ ('/assets/images/home/person-' + face + '.jpg') | url }}" alt="" width="36" height="36" loading="eager"
             class="photo-warm h-9 w-9 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-paper">
        {% endfor %}
        <span class="!ml-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/50">Recently placed</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9">
      <h1 class="font-display text-[3.25rem] font-semibold leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink sm:text-[5.5rem] lg:text-[7.25rem]">
        Where careers<br>
        find their <em class="not-italic text-accent">footing</em>.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figure class="mt-12">
    <div class="photo-frame aspect-[16/7] w-full">
      <img src="{{ '/assets/images/home/hero-team-meeting.jpg' | url }}" alt="A recruiter and two candidates talking around a table"
           width="1400" height="613" fetchpriority="high"
           class="photo-warm h-full w-full object-cover">
    </div>
    <figcaption class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-1 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/45 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <span>Fig. 01 — Placement review, Wabash Ave office</span>
      <span>Every match is made by a person who read the résumé</span>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-8 border-t border-ink pt-8">
    <p class="col-span-12 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-5">
      We match people to work worth doing, and employers to talent worth hiring — one conversation at a time, never by keyword filter.
    </p>
    <div class="col-span-12 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row md:col-span-6 md:justify-end lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9">
      <a href="{{ '/services/job-placement/' | url }}" class="btn-primary">Find a Job</a>
      <a href="{{ '/services/recruitment-staffing/' | url }}" class="btn-outline">Hire Talent</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 2. Employer wall ---------- #}
{% set placedAtLead = "Our people work here now." %}
{% include "partials/placed-at.njk" %}

{# ---------- 3. Stats as a typographic rule row ---------- #}
<section class="section-container py-14 sm:py-20">
  <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 border-t border-ink lg:grid-cols-4">
    {% for stat in stats.list %}
    <div class="border-b border-ink/15 px-0 py-7 lg:border-b-0 lg:px-7 lg:py-9 {% if not loop.last %}lg:border-r lg:border-ink/15{% endif %} {% if loop.first %}lg:pl-0{% endif %}">
      <dd class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
          data-count-up data-target="{{ stat.value }}" data-suffix="{{ stat.suffix }}">0{{ stat.suffix }}</dd>
      <dt class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/50">{{ stat.label }}</dt>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>

{# ---------- 4. Manifesto ---------- #}
<section class="section-container border-t border-ink/15 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-8">
    <p class="col-span-12 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/45 lg:col-span-2 lg:pt-4">§ 01 — Position</p>
    <blockquote class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9 lg:col-start-4">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl leading-[1.24] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.9rem]">
        Most agencies optimise for volume. We optimise for the
        <span class="border-b-4 border-accent">second year</span> —
        whether the person is still in the role, still growing, still glad they took the call.
      </p>
      <footer class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/50">
        <span class="h-px w-10 bg-ink/30"></span> {{ site.companyName }}
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 5. Case study: zig-zag with photo ---------- #}
<section class="section-container py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-10">
    <figure class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6">
      <div class="photo-frame aspect-[4/3]">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/images/home/interview-conversation.jpg' | url }}" alt="A candidate in conversation with a hiring manager"
             width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy"
             class="photo-warm h-full w-full object-cover">
      </div>
    </figure>

    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">§ 02 — Case study</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-[2.6rem]">
        Forty applications, no replies. Then two weeks.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
        Priya had a strong analytics background and a résumé that buried it on page two. We rebuilt the profile around the work she actually wanted, introduced her to three employers who needed exactly that, and prepped her for each conversation.
      </p>

      <dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-ink/15 pt-6">
        {% set caseFacts = [
          { k: "Time to offer", v: "16 days" },
          { k: "Interviews", v: "3" },
          { k: "Placed at", v: "Amazon" }
        ] %}
        {% for fact in caseFacts %}
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/45">{{ fact.k }}</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">{{ fact.v }}</dd>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>

      <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/images/home/person-priya.jpg' | url }}" alt="" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy"
             class="photo-warm h-11 w-11 rounded-full object-cover">
        <span>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink">Priya Nandakumar</span>
          <span class="block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/50">Data Analyst, Amazon</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 6. Services as a numbered index ---------- #}
<section class="section-container py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6">
    <p class="col-span-12 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/45 lg:col-span-2">§ 03 — Services</p>
    <h2 class="col-span-12 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:col-span-9 lg:col-start-4">
      Five services, one pipeline.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="border-b border-ink/15">
    {% for service in services.list %}
    <a href="{{ service.url | url }}" class="ed-row group">
      <span class="col-span-2 font-mono text-xs text-ink/40 transition-colors group-hover:text-accent lg:col-span-1">
        {{ "0" if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }}
      </span>
      <h3 class="col-span-10 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-2xl lg:col-span-4 lg:text-3xl">
        {{ service.title }}
      </h3>
      <p class="col-span-12 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65 sm:text-base lg:col-span-5 lg:pl-4">
        {{ service.shortDescription }}
      </p>
      <span class="col-span-12 flex text-ink/40 transition-all group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-accent lg:col-span-2 lg:justify-end">
        {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-5 h-5") }}
      </span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 7. Industries ---------- #}
<section class="section-container py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6">
    <p class="col-span-12 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/45 lg:col-span-2">§ 04 — Sectors</p>
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9 lg:col-start-4">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-5xl">
        Where our people land.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
        Share of placements over the last twelve months. We say no to sectors we don't know — a recruiter who claims all of them knows none of them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <dl class="border-t border-ink">
    {% for industry in industries.list %}
    <div class="ed-row group">
      <dt class="col-span-12 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-2xl lg:col-span-5">
        {{ industry.name }}
      </dt>
      <dd class="col-span-8 text-sm text-ink/60 lg:col-span-4">{{ industry.roles }}</dd>
      <dd class="col-span-4 text-right lg:col-span-3">
        <span class="font-mono text-lg text-ink/70 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">{{ industry.share }}</span>
      </dd>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>

{# ---------- 8. Training → placement pipeline ---------- #}
<section class="border-y border-ink bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-10">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">No experience yet?</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-[2.75rem]">
          Most training providers hand you a certificate.
          <span class="border-b-4 border-accent">We hand you the interview.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
          Our IT Training tracks end where every other course stops — graduates go straight into the same placement pipeline as everyone else on this page. Same recruiters, same employers, no separate queue.
        </p>
        <a href="{{ '/services/it-training/' | url }}" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 border-accent pb-0.5 font-medium text-ink transition-all hover:gap-3">
          See the training tracks {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9">
        <ol class="border-t border-ink">
          {% for stage in ["Enrol", "Learn", "Build a project", "Certify", "Get placed"] %}
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-4 border-b border-ink/15 py-3.5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs {% if loop.last %}text-accent{% else %}text-ink/40{% endif %}">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span class="font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight {% if loop.last %}text-accent{% else %}text-ink{% endif %}">{{ stage }}</span>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
        <div class="mt-7 border-t border-ink pt-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-2xl text-ink">19 <span class="text-ink/35">/ 24</span></p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
            Last cohort placed within 90 days of certifying.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 9. Live placement feed ---------- #}
{% include "partials/placement-feed.njk" %}

{# ---------- 8. What we believe ---------- #}
<section class="border-y border-ink/15 bg-surface py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="mb-12 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6">
      <p class="col-span-12 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/45 lg:col-span-2">§ 05 — Beliefs</p>
      <h2 class="col-span-12 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:col-span-9 lg:col-start-4">
        Four things we won't budge on.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% set beliefs = [
        { n: "01", t: "Careers, not jobs", d: "We'll talk you out of a role that pays more and leads nowhere. It costs us a placement and saves you two years." },
        { n: "02", t: "A person reads it", d: "No keyword filter has ever understood a career change. Every résumé that comes in is read by a recruiter." },
        { n: "03", t: "Deadlines are deadlines", d: "If we say Thursday, it's Thursday. Hiring managers plan around us and candidates wait on us." },
        { n: "04", t: "The relationship outlasts the placement", d: "We check in at ninety days, and again when you're ready to move. Most of our work comes back to us." }
      ] %}
      {% for belief in beliefs %}
      <div class="border-t border-ink pt-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-accent">{{ belief.n }}</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">{{ belief.t }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">{{ belief.d }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 9. Dual path with photos ---------- #}
<section class="section-container py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-14">
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5">
      <div class="photo-frame mb-7 aspect-[3/2]">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/images/home/team-at-desk.jpg' | url }}" alt="Two colleagues reviewing work at a shared desk"
             width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy" class="photo-warm h-full w-full object-cover">
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">For job seekers</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-4xl">
        You've sent the applications. Now send one conversation.
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
        Personal matching, interview coaching, and offer support — from your first role to your next move.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5">
        {% for point in ["Profile rebuilt around the work you want", "Introductions to verified employers", "Prep before every interview", "Negotiation help on the offer"] %}
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink/70">
          <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent">{{ icon("check", "w-4 h-4") }}</span> {{ point }}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <a href="{{ '/services/job-placement/' | url }}" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 border-accent pb-0.5 font-medium text-ink transition-all hover:gap-3">
        Explore job placement {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8">
      <div class="photo-frame mb-7 aspect-[3/2]">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/images/home/office-collaboration.jpg' | url }}" alt="A hiring team meeting in an open office"
             width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy" class="photo-warm h-full w-full object-cover">
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">For employers</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-4xl">
        Fewer résumés. The right three.
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
        Sourced, screened, and verified candidates — matched to the role you actually described.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5">
        {% for point in ["Brief taken by someone who'll own it", "Shortlists, not résumé dumps", "Background checks handled in-house", "Average time-to-fill under four weeks"] %}
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink/70">
          <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent">{{ icon("check", "w-4 h-4") }}</span> {{ point }}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <a href="{{ '/services/recruitment-staffing/' | url }}" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 border-accent pb-0.5 font-medium text-ink transition-all hover:gap-3">
        Explore hiring services {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 10. Big pull quote ---------- #}
<section class="border-y border-ink bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="section-container">
    <figure class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-10">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-3">
        <div class="photo-frame aspect-square w-32 rounded-full lg:w-full lg:rounded-none">
          <img src="{{ '/assets/images/home/person-lena.jpg' | url }}" alt="Lena Toma" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"
               class="photo-warm h-full w-full object-cover">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 lg:col-start-5">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl leading-[1.26] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.6rem]">
          &ldquo;I was switching fields at thirty-four and every recruiter treated that as a problem to explain away. These ones treated it as the story.&rdquo;
        </p>
        <figcaption class="mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/50">
          Lena Toma — DevOps Engineer, Nvidia
        </figcaption>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 11. Testimonials ---------- #}
<section class="section-container py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6">
    <p class="col-span-12 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/45 lg:col-span-2">§ 06 — Voices</p>
    <h2 class="col-span-12 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:col-span-9 lg:col-start-4">
      Placed, hired, and heard from.
    </h2>
  </div>

  {# Priya is the case study and Lena is the pull quote — excluded so no story is told twice. #}
  {% set featuredElsewhere = ["priya", "lena"] %}
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {% for testimonial in testimonials.list %}
    {% if testimonial.slug not in featuredElsewhere %}
    <figure class="border-t border-ink pt-6">
      <blockquote class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75">&ldquo;{{ testimonial.quote }}&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="{{ testimonial.photo | url }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy"
             class="photo-warm h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover">
        <span>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ testimonial.name }}</span>
          <span class="block font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/50">{{ testimonial.role }} · {{ testimonial.company }}</span>
        </span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 12. Process ---------- #}
<section class="section-container py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6">
    <p class="col-span-12 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/45 lg:col-span-2">§ 07 — Process</p>
    <h2 class="col-span-12 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:col-span-9 lg:col-start-4">
      How it actually goes.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 border-t border-ink sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    {% set edSteps = [
      { label: "Apply", description: "Tell us where you are and where you want to be — takes ten minutes." },
      { label: "Match", description: "We connect you with roles and employers that actually fit the brief." },
      { label: "Interview", description: "Coaching and prep before every conversation that matters." },
      { label: "Placement", description: "An offer, a negotiation assist, and a check-in 90 days in." }
    ] %}
    {% for step in edSteps %}
    <li class="border-b border-ink/15 py-8 lg:border-b-0 lg:px-7 {% if not loop.last %}lg:border-r lg:border-ink/15{% endif %} {% if loop.first %}lg:pl-0{% endif %}">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-accent">{{ "0" if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }}</span>
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">{{ step.label }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">{{ step.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

{# ---------- 13. CTA ---------- #}
<section class="bg-ink py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="section-container text-center">
    <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.03em] text-paper sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
      Ready to find your footing?
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-paper/60">
      Whether you're job hunting or hiring, the first conversation is free.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-accent pb-1 font-display text-2xl text-paper transition-all hover:gap-5 sm:text-3xl">
      Start the conversation {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-6 h-6") }}
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/variant-switcher.njk" %}
